{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34272","headline":"庆封宅古井行 · 陆龟蒙","name":"庆封宅古井行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古甓团团藓花碧，鼎渫寒泉深百尺。\n江南戴白尽能言，此地曾爲庆封宅。\n庆封嗜酒荒齐政，齐人剪族封奔迸。\n虽过鲁国羞鲁儒，欲弄吴民窃吴柄。\n吴分岩邑号朱方，子家负固心强梁。\n泽车豪马驰似水，锦凤玉龙森若墙。\n一朝云梦围兵至，胸陷锋鋩脑涂地。\n因知富德不富财，颜氏箪瓢有深意。\n宣父尝违盗泉水，懦夫立事贪夫止。\n今歌此井示吴人，断绠沉瓶自兹始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}